# The checks branch protection on main requires.
#
# scripts/check-required-contexts.sh (the workflow lint job and `make check`)
# fails when these lines and the pull-request jobs of the `workflow` files
# disagree, in either direction. Add a job to one of these workflows and its
# name goes here in the same pull request, and in branch protection:
#
#   gh api repos/neb-abera/Facewoof/branches/main/protection \
#     --jq '.required_status_checks.contexts[]'
#
# workflow <path>   a workflow whose pull-request jobs gate merges
# check <name>      a job name, as the job reports it
workflow .github/workflows/checks.yml
workflow .github/workflows/codeql.yml
workflow .github/workflows/security-scan.yml
check lint and format
check production image
check smoke test against postgres
check lint (actionlint + shellcheck)
check analyze (javascript-typescript)
check analyze (actions)
check container scan (trivy)
check dependency review
